  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the symbolism of resilience and interconnectedness with this beautiful Jeminise Quilt Set, featuring the stunning Tree of Life design. Perfect for adding a touch of meaningful decor to your home or as a thoughtful gift for loved ones, this quilt offers warmth and comfort throughout all seasons.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Amazing Yggdrasil Quilt Design:</strong> Features the iconic Tree of Life, symbolizing resilience, strength, and interconnectedness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches) to perfectly fit various bed sizes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Professional Design:</strong> Crafted with specially designed colorful themes on smooth material, suitable for both functional use and decorative appeal.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An ideal gift for housewarmings, weddings, or special occasions, perfect for family members like moms, dads, sisters, brothers, grandmas, grandpas, wives, husbands, sons, and daughters.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Comes with 1 Quilt, with an optional Pillowcase.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat. Microfiber dries quickly and becomes fluffier.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Provides warmth for indoor and outdoor use, ideal for beds, sofas, reading, relaxing, camping, and picnics.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton, Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Colorful Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Minimalist</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw(60x70 inches)| Twin(68x86 inches)| Full(80x90 inches)| Queen (90x90 inches)| King (91x102 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
